This package is a standalone CarbonEngineJS-facing reader and decoder for Ogg
Vorbis data. Its implementation is original CarbonEngineJS project code except
for the specifically attributed reference material below.
CarbonEngine and Fenris Creations (CCP Games) are mentioned for
interoperability, provenance, and future migration context only. This package is
not affiliated with or endorsed by CCP Games.

Third-party reference material
------------------------------

stb_vorbis
Repository: https://github.com/nothings/stb/blob/master/stb_vorbis.c
Author: Sean Barrett
License: public domain or MIT, at the user's option

The pure-JavaScript Vorbis decoder was implemented independently from the
Vorbis I specification. `stb_vorbis` was consulted as a behavioral reference
and is the source of the specification's floor1 `inverse_db_table` constants.
No `stb_vorbis` implementation code is vendored or translated into this
package.
